This harness consumes the IBM Substrait Compliance Framework
(https://github.com/IBM/substrait-compliance) as an external test-suite
source, through the `spiceai` branch of the spiceai/substrait-compliance
fork (https://github.com/spiceai/substrait-compliance): IBM's `main` plus
the TPC-H q01 shipdate-cutoff correction, pinned at commit
43d31411c69ef7594887c7d759037bcf8244eeed. The suite is cloned at run time (and in CI)
and is not vendored into this tree.

